'''Coal''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2022 Christmas Box|Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2022|2022 Christmas Event]].  It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Coal uses the default mesh for a knife resembling a chunk of coal, hence the name. The blade contains shades of black and grey to give the knife texture, whilst the guard and handle are both black. 

==Trivia==
*It has a [[Coal Gun (2022)|partner gun]] under the same name.
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].

